      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "While pseudoephedrine is a stimulant, the interaction with haloperidol can still lead to serious side effects, especially affecting your cardiovascular system. I cannot advise you on whether it is \"safe\" because I am not your doctor, and only a professional can assess your specific health profile. For immediate relief while waiting for an appointment, try an over-the-counter antihistamine if your congestion has an allergic component, but please seek professional medical advice for drug combinations.",
      "source": "target",
